--- **DEPRECATED**:
--- Aka TEXTUREFLAGS_UNUSED_40000000
global TEXTUREFLAGS_STREAMABLE_COARSE: E_TEXTUREFLAGS = 1073741824
--- @deprecated
--- **DEPRECATED**:
--- Aka TEXTUREFLAGS_UNUSED_80000000
global TEXTUREFLAGS_STREAMABLE_FINE: E_TEXTUREFLAGS = 2147483648

