end

--- This function can be used in a for loop instead of Global.pairs. It sorts all **keys** alphabetically.
--- For sorting by specific **value member**, use Global.SortedPairsByMemberValue.
--- For sorting by **value**, use Global.SortedPairsByValue.
-- [View source](https://github.com/Facepunch/garrysmod/blob/master/garrysmod/lua/includes/extensions/table.lua#L552-L576)
-- @param table --- The table to sort
-- @param desc --- Reverse the sorting order
-- @return --- Iterator function
-- @return --- The table being iterated over
global function SortedPairs(table: table, desc: boolean): function, table
end

--- Returns an iterator function that can be used to loop through a table in order of member values, when the values of the table are also tables and contain that member.
--- To sort by **value**, use Global.SortedPairsByValue.
--- To sort by **keys**, use Global.SortedPairs.
-- [View source](https://github.com/Facepunch/garrysmod/blob/master/garrysmod/lua/includes/extensions/table.lua#L578-L612)
-- @param table --- Table to create iterator for.
-- @param memberKey --- Key of the value member to sort by.
-- @param descending --- Whether the iterator should iterate in descending order or not.
-- @return --- Iterator function
-- @return --- The table the iterator was created for.
global function SortedPairsByMemberValue(table: table, memberKey: any, descending: boolean): function, table
end

--- Returns an iterator function that can be used to loop through a table in order of its **values**.
--- To sort by specific **value member**, use Global.SortedPairsByMemberValue.
--- To sort by **keys**, use Global.SortedPairs.
-- [View source](https://github.com/Facepunch/garrysmod/blob/master/garrysmod/lua/includes/extensions/table.lua#L578-L594)
-- @param table --- Table to create iterator for
-- @param descending --- Whether the iterator should iterate in descending order or not
-- @return --- Iterator function
-- @return --- The table which will be iterated over
global function SortedPairsByValue(table: table, descending: boolean): function, table
end

--- Runs util.PrecacheSound and returns the string.
