    -- @return --- A table containing all of the constrained entities. This includes all entities constrained to entities constrained to the supplied entity, etc.
    GetAllConstrainedEntities: function(ent: GEntity, resultTable: table): table

    --- Returns a table of all constraints directly connected to the entity.
    --- If you are looking for a list of specific constraint(s), use constraint.FindConstraints.
